{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13754","headline":"金璫玉佩歌 · 顾况","name":"金璫玉佩歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赠君金璫太霄之玉佩，金锁禹步之流珠。\n五岳真君之秘籙，九天丈人之宝书。\n东井沐浴辰已毕，先进洞房上奔日。\n借问君欲何处来，黄姑织女机边出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}